== Description ==

'''Nitrate Powder''' is an item in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Biochemical Workbench]]. It appears as an ingredient in 4 downstream recipes at the [[Biochemical Workbench]] and the [[Furnace]], including [[Painkiller]], [[Tempered Glass]], [[Gunpowder]], [[Antibiotics]]. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

